WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The ten beads are all real sacred objects that are more than a thousand years old.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Thousands of years? How much is it worth?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Fan Qingxiang has spent 200 million in cash to buy a plant to save her grandfather

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The remaining nine beads are all here

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Bidding starts on December 1st at our own auction house

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Until then

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The world's top wealthy people will come to Xiangcheng

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
We must be fully prepared

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,030
Two hundred million, one plant and ten beads

10
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:24,600
Go to the deep mountains and forests

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,600
200 million will be received in ten days

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,600
The remaining nine beads are valued at 1.8 billion

13
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,600
What a terrifying speed of making money this is

14
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,600
Changbai Mountain is so big

15
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,600
Didn’t other professional villagers dig it?

16
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,600
Dozens of top treasure hunters from abroad and abroad search the mountain together

17
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,600
They're a bit unlucky

18
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,600
Return completely empty

19
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,600
Thousands of years of life are desirable but unattainable

20
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,600
Brute force alone is not enough

21
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:50,460
It still depends on whether God will reward you or not. The boss will not accept it.

22
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,460
Boss, you are back alive
